# More mob commands from the stage manager (30005) in the fixture area tools/fixtures/files/mobcmds.are, with
# area_update and violence_update running, in the temple (3001), cued by Decimus (10, 1000 hit points). Pupil
# (10) is grouped with him; the understudy (30006) is there too.
# - travel: goto, at, transfer (one, all, here), gtransfer and otransfer (from the floor, and worn), with bad
#   locations
# - forces: force, force all, gforce, vforce
# - spells: each kind of target; an object-or-character spell on a character does nothing
# - hurt: damage within the hit points, all, and with kill
# - remember: remember, forget, delay and cancel; subroutine: mob call with a character and an object
# - strip: remove by vnum (the banner's light leaves the mob, not Decimus: #89) and all
# - fight: kill a player; then, with Decimus fighting the understudy, assist him (it attacks the understudy)
# - flee: not fighting, it goes (a fighting mob doesn't hear the cue: speech triggers wait for its default
#   position)
@place mobcmds.are mobcmds.are
@place area-mobcmds.lst area.lst
@updates area,violence
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
holylight
@connect pupil
Pupil
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
transfer pupil 3001
set char decimus hp 1000
restore decimus
@mob 30006 3001
@mob 30005 3001
@as pupil
follow decimus
@as dec
group pupil
say travel
@pulse 4
look
@as god
goto 3001
@as dec
say forces
@pulse 4
say spells
@pulse 24
say hurt
@pulse 4
say remember
say subroutine
@state
say strip
@state
say fight
@pulse 48
@as god
peace
@as dec
@pulse 12
kill understudy
say fight
@pulse 24
@as god
peace
@as dec
@pulse 12
say flee
@state
